// Memory-tile descriptors for attention replay and resident token panels.
// Query, key, value, and identity streams use separate receivers and credits.
// Packed panel storage stays owned until its corresponding completion wait;
// reentry reuses this routing without another model invocation.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.configuration

